Description: Simulation, estimation and forecasting of univariate and
    multivariate generalized autoregressive score models. Time-varying
    distributional parameters are updated using the score of the conditional
    distribution, with alternative score scaling specifications. Provides
    maximum likelihood estimation, filtering, density forecasting and
    rolling forecast evaluation for a range of conditional distributions.
    Includes diagnostic tools and methods for evaluating Value-at-Risk and
    Expected Shortfall forecasts. The models and their applications are
    described in Ardia et al. (2019) <doi:10.18637/jss.v088.i06>.
